{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36856","headline":"裴庶子除太仆卿因贺 · 罗隐","name":"裴庶子除太仆卿因贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚珪班序未爲轻，莫惜良途副圣明。\n宫省旧推皇甫谧，寺曹今得夏侯婴。\n秩随科第临时贵，官逐簪裾到处清。\n应笑马安虚巧宦，四回迁转始爲卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}